# Campana: Chowning §V uses an inharmonic ratio (N2 non-integer) to get a
# non-periodic spectrum, plus a percussive envelope (very fast attack, no
# sustain, long release). N1=1, N2=1.4 → inharmonic sidebands.
# I≈47 semitones → β = (2^(47/12)−1)/1.4 ≈ 10 sidebands of significant magnitude.
1	InstrumentFM	ADSR_A=0.005; ADSR_D=2.5; ADSR_S=0.0; ADSR_R=0.5; N1=1; N2=1.4; I=47;
